<hr data-start="285" data-end="288" class="">
<h3 data-start="290" data-end="305" class=""><strong data-start="294" data-end="303">Title</strong></h3>
<p data-start="306" data-end="419" class=""><strong data-start="306" data-end="419">"Countering Capitalist Modalities: A Triadic Framework of Psychocinema, Geometric Bayesianism, and SpherePop"</strong></p>
