<h3 data-start="426" data-end="444" class=""><strong data-start="430" data-end="442">Abstract</strong></h3>
<p data-start="445" data-end="1082" class="">This paper introduces a triadic theoretical framework‚ÄîPsychocinema, Geometric Bayesianism, and SpherePop‚Äîas a multi-level counter-strategy to three interlocking capitalist formations: Necrocapitalism, Surveillance Capitalism, and Chokepoint Capitalism. Drawing from psychoanalysis, epistemic geometry, and symbolic systems design, the paper demonstrates how each counter-framework addresses the distinct logic of extraction, control, and dispossession characteristic of its corresponding capitalist mode. It concludes by proposing this triad as a conceptual and applied toolkit for resistance, cognitive autonomy, and expressive freedom.</p>
<hr data-start="1084" data-end="1087" class="">
