</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1567" data-end="1766" class="">
<p data-start="1569" data-end="1766" class="">Thesis: This essay proposes a triadic counter-framework‚ÄîPsychocinema, Geometric Bayesianism, and SpherePop‚Äîthat resists these modalities across psychological, epistemological, and symbolic domains.</p>
</li>
</ul>
