<p data-start="1834" data-end="1885" class=""><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Œõ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Œõ</span></span></span></span>: precision matrix (belief strength)</p>
