<hr data-start="2732" data-end="2735" class="">
<h3 data-start="2737" data-end="2807" class=""><strong data-start="2741" data-end="2786">QPR-IV: Exploratory Divergence Relaxation</strong> <em data-start="2787" data-end="2805">(GB + SpherePop)</em></h3>
