<hr data-start="3580" data-end="3583" class="">
<h3 data-start="3585" data-end="3622" class=""><strong data-start="3589" data-end="3622">Unified Negentropic Objective</strong></h3>
<p data-start="3624" data-end="3669" class="">Let each QPR contribute to global negentropy:</p>
