<li data-start="1380" data-end="1491" class="">
<p data-start="1382" data-end="1491" class="">Enables <strong data-start="1390" data-end="1421">partial symbolic resolution</strong> in complex idea nets‚Äîkeeps conceptual structures fluid and navigable.</p>
