<h3 data-start="1498" data-end="1538" class=""><strong data-start="1502" data-end="1536">II. QPR in Integer Programming</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1539" data-end="1628" class=""><strong data-start="1539" data-end="1550">Purpose</strong>: Generate upper bounds or heuristics for integer-constrained decision spaces.</p>
<p data-start="1630" data-end="1654" class=""><strong data-start="1630" data-end="1653">Relaxation Strategy</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="1655" data-end="1791">
