<h3 data-start="2164" data-end="2216" class=""><strong data-start="2168" data-end="2214">III. QPR in Semidefinite Programming (SDP)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="2217" data-end="2316" class=""><strong data-start="2217" data-end="2228">Purpose</strong>: Relax non-convex SDP problems into tractable convex SDPs by removing rank constraints.</p>
<p data-start="2318" data-end="2342" class=""><strong data-start="2318" data-end="2341">Relaxation Strategy</strong>:</p>
