<hr data-start="240" data-end="243" class="">
<h3 data-start="245" data-end="299" class=""><strong data-start="249" data-end="297">1. Mixed-Integer Polynomial Optimization QPR</strong></h3>
<p data-start="300" data-end="314" class=""><strong data-start="300" data-end="312">Formula:</strong></p>
