<p data-start="474" data-end="942" class=""><strong data-start="474" data-end="487">Overview:</strong><br data-start="487" data-end="490">
This relaxation addresses optimization problems involving both integer variables and polynomial terms. By relaxing integrality constraints and quadratizing higher-degree polynomials (e.g. via sum-of-squares decompositions), it transforms a hard symbolic-numeric problem into a solvable convex form. In symbolic cognition, this models <em data-start="824" data-end="854">hybrid compositional systems</em>, where logic (integers) and continuous analog quantities (emotions, beliefs) co-evolve.</p>
<hr data-start="944" data-end="947" class="">
<h3 data-start="949" data-end="992" class=""><strong data-start="953" data-end="990">2. Combinatorial Optimization QPR</strong></h3>
<p data-start="993" data-end="1007" class=""><strong data-start="993" data-end="1005">Formula:</strong></p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>‚Å°</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>‚àà</mo><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence="true">{</mo><mstyle displaystyle="false" scriptlevel="0"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>‚àë</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="true">}</mo></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mtext>subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;relaxed&nbsp;discrete&nbsp;constraints</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\min_{x \in [0,1]^n} \left\{ \tfrac{1}{2}x^T P x + q^T x + \sum_i s_i \right\}, \quad \text{subject to relaxed discrete constraints}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 3.0277em; vertical-align: -1.2777em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6679em;"><span style="top: -2.309em; margin-left: 0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span><span class="mrel mtight">‚àà</span><span class="mopen mtight">[</span><span class="mord mtight">0</span><span class="mpunct mtight">,</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span><span class="mclose mtight"><span class="mclose mtight">]</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.5935em;"><span style="top: -2.786em; margin-right: 0.0714em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.5em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span><span class="mop">min</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.966em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner"><span class="mopen delimcenter" style="top: 0em;"><span class="delimsizing size4">{</span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8451em;"><span style="top: -2.655em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width: 0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top: -3.394em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.345em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8913em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">q</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8913em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.05em;"><span style="top: -1.8723em; margin-left: 0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3.05em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span><span style="top: -3.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3.05em;"></span><span><span class="mop op-symbol large-op">‚àë</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.2777em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">s</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose delimcenter" style="top: 0em;"><span class="delimsizing size4">}</span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;relaxed&nbsp;discrete&nbsp;constraints</span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="1149" data-end="1545" class=""><strong data-start="1149" data-end="1162">Overview:</strong><br data-start="1162" data-end="1165">
Here, discrete structures such as paths, matchings, or groupings are approximated through continuous relaxations (e.g. LP or convex hull). Slack variables absorb violations of combinatorial constraints. This is vital in symbolic systems (e.g. SpherePop), where decision trees or logic branches must be traversed without hard commitment‚Äîmodeling <strong data-start="1510" data-end="1544">exploratory symbolic inference</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="1547" data-end="1550" class="">
<h3 data-start="1552" data-end="1588" class=""><strong data-start="1556" data-end="1586">3. Integer Programming QPR</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1589" data-end="1603" class=""><strong data-start="1589" data-end="1601">Formula:</strong></p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>‚Å°</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>‚àà</mo><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence="true">{</mo><mstyle displaystyle="false" scriptlevel="0"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Œª</mi><munder><mo>‚àë</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi mathvariant="normal">‚à£</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‚àí</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">‚à£</mi><mo fence="true">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\min_{x \in [0,1]^n} \left\{ \tfrac{1}{2}x^T P x + q^T x + \lambda \sum_i |x_i - \text{round}(x_i)| \right\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 3.0277em; vertical-align: -1.2777em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6679em;"><span style="top: -2.309em; margin-left: 0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span><span class="mrel mtight">‚àà</span><span class="mopen mtight">[</span><span class="mord mtight">0</span><span class="mpunct mtight">,</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span><span class="mclose mtight"><span class="mclose mtight">]</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.5935em;"><span style="top: -2.786em; margin-right: 0.0714em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.5em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span><span class="mop">min</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.966em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner"><span class="mopen delimcenter" style="top: 0em;"><span class="delimsizing size4">{</span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8451em;"><span style="top: -2.655em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width: 0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top: -3.394em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.345em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8913em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">q</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8913em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">Œª</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.05em;"><span style="top: -1.8723em; margin-left: 0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3.05em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span><span style="top: -3.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3.05em;"></span><span><span class="mop op-symbol large-op">‚àë</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.2777em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">‚à£</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">‚àí</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">round</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">‚à£</span><span class="mclose delimcenter" style="top: 0em;"><span class="delimsizing size4">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="1721" data-end="2052" class=""><strong data-start="1721" data-end="1734">Overview:</strong><br data-start="1734" data-end="1737">
Binary (0‚Äì1) variables are relaxed to lie within the unit interval, and penalty terms softly enforce integrality. In cognitive modeling, this enables <strong data-start="1887" data-end="1932">approximate reasoning over logical spaces</strong>‚Äîuseful in belief revision, conceptual ambiguity, or transitional logic states (e.g., between contradictory hypotheses).</p>
<hr data-start="2054" data-end="2057" class="">
<h3 data-start="2059" data-end="2100" class=""><strong data-start="2063" data-end="2098">4. Semidefinite Programming QPR</strong></h3>
<p data-start="2101" data-end="2115" class=""><strong data-start="2101" data-end="2113">Formula:</strong></p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>‚Å°</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>‚™∞</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence="true">{</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>x</mi><mo fence="true">}</mo></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mtext>with&nbsp;</mtext><mi>X</mi><mo>‚âà</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\min_{X \succeq 0} \left\{ \mathrm{tr}(P X) + q^T x \right\}, \quad \text{with } X \approx xx^T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.7308em; vertical-align: -0.8395em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6679em;"><span style="top: -2.3557em; margin-left: 0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">X</span><span class="mrel mtight">‚™∞</span><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span><span class="mop">min</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8395em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner"><span class="mopen delimcenter" style="top: 0em;"><span class="delimsizing size1">{</span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">tr</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">PX</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">q</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8913em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mclose delimcenter" style="top: 0em;"><span class="delimsizing size1">}</span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">with&nbsp;</span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">X</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">‚âà</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8913em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8913em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="2220" data-end="2576" class=""><strong data-start="2220" data-end="2233">Overview:</strong><br data-start="2233" data-end="2236">
This approach drops rank constraints to allow convex optimization over positive semidefinite matrices. It is essential in modeling <strong data-start="2367" data-end="2419">multi-layered affective-symbolic representations</strong>‚Äîfor example, in Psychocinema where meanings are manifold and non-linear. The PSD matrix encodes distributed coherence across partially repressed narratives.</p>
<hr data-start="2578" data-end="2581" class="">
<h3 data-start="2583" data-end="2623" class=""><strong data-start="2587" data-end="2621">5. Polynomial Optimization QPR</strong></h3>
<p data-start="2624" data-end="2638" class=""><strong data-start="2624" data-end="2636">Formula:</strong></p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>‚Å°</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>‚àà</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="double-struck">R</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence="true">{</mo><munder><mo>‚àë</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence="true">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="false" scriptlevel="0"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo fence="true">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mtext>slack&nbsp;for&nbsp;</mtext><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mtext>&nbsp;terms</mtext><mo fence="true">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\min_{x \in \mathbb{R}^n} \left\{ \sum_i \left( \tfrac{1}{2} x^T P_i x + q_i^T x \right) + \text{slack for } x^d \text{ terms} \right\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 3.0277em; vertical-align: -1.2777em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6679em;"><span style="top: -2.3518em; margin-left: 0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span><span class="mrel mtight">‚àà</span><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathbb mtight">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.5935em;"><span style="top: -2.786em; margin-right: 0.0714em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.5em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=