<hr data-start="347" data-end="350" class="">
<h2 data-start="352" data-end="394" class=""><strong data-start="355" data-end="394">QPR Functional Module Demonstration</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start="396" data-end="451" class=""><strong data-start="400" data-end="412">Scenario</strong>: Symbolic Rerouting in the Yarncrawler</h3>
<p data-start="453" data-end="693" class="">You are designing a planetary-scale cognitive traversal engine (<em data-start="517" data-end="530">Yarncrawler</em>) that navigates a symbolic mesh of meanings. You want it to decide <strong data-start="598" data-end="634">how to reroute a symbolic thread</strong> when encountering a semiotic bottleneck or ambiguity node.</p>
<hr data-start="695" data-end="698" class="">
<h3 data-start="700" data-end="736" class=""><strong data-start="704" data-end="736">1. Define the Cognitive Task</strong></h3>
<p data-start="738" data-end="850" class=""><strong data-start="738" data-end="746">Goal</strong>: Update a symbolic path through a network of conceptual nodes to avoid collapse or entropic stagnation.</p>
<p data-start="852" data-end="868" class=""><strong data-start="852" data-end="867">Constraints</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="869" data-end="964">
<li data-start="869" data-end="895" class="">
<p data-start="871" data-end="895" class="">Avoid high-entropy loops</p>
</li>
<li data-start="896" data-end="925" class="">
<p data-start="898" data-end="925" class="">Preserve meaning continuity</p>
</li>
<li data-start="926" data-end="964" class="">
<p data-start="928" data-end="964" class="">Allow partial symbolic recomposition</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="966" data-end="969" class="">
<h3 data-start="971" data-end="997" class=""><strong data-start="975" data-end="997">2. Select QPR Type</strong></h3>
<p data-start="999" data-end="1066" class="">Choose a QPR module based on the symbolic structure of the problem:</p>
<div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="1068" data-end="1401" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1068" data-end="1122"><tr data-start="1068" data-end="1122"><th data-start="1068" data-end="1093" data-col-size="sm">Structure</th><th data-start="1093" data-end="1122" data-col-size="sm">QPR Module</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1178" data-end="1401"><tr data-start="1178" data-end="1232"><td data-start="1178" data-end="1203" data-col-size="sm">Tree or graph rewrite</td><td data-start="1203" data-end="1232" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1205" data-end="1226">Combinatorial QPR</strong></td></tr><tr data-start="1233" data-end="1289"><td data-start="1233" data-end="1258" data-col-size="sm">Binary symbolic gates</td><td data-start="1258" data-end="1289" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1260" data-end="1287">Integer Programming QPR</strong></td></tr><tr data-start="1290" data-end="1345"><td data-start="1290" data-end="1315" data-col-size="sm">Nested semantic layers</td><td data-start="1315" data-end="1345" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1317" data-end="1335">Polynomial QPR</strong></td></tr><tr data-start="1346" data-end="1401"><td data-start="1346" data-end="1371" data-col-size="sm">High-uncertainty nodes</td><td data-start="1371" data-end="1401" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1373" data-end="1391">Stochastic QPR</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7031px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="bg-token-bg-primary hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<p data-start="1403" data-end="1469" class=""><strong data-start="1403" data-end="1413">Chosen</strong>: <em data-start="1415" data-end="1434">Combinatorial QPR</em> for rerouting symbolic knot-paths.</p>
<hr data-start="1471" data-end="1474" class="">
<h3 data-start="1476" data-end="1519" class=""><strong data-start="1480" data-end="1519">3. Formulate the Relaxation Program</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1521" data-end="1554" class="">Define your optimization problem:</p>
<ul data-start="1556" data-end="1874">
<li data-start="1556" data-end="1644" class="">
<p data-start="1558" data-end="1644" class="">Let each symbolic edge <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‚àà</mo><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_i \in \{0,1\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6891em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">‚àà</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">{</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">}</span></span></span></span> represent inclusion in the rerouted path.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1645" data-end="1719" class="">
<p data-start="1647" data-end="1719" class="">Assign cost/entropy <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.5806em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">c</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> to each edge based on symbolic distortion.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1720" data-end="1775" class="">
<p data-start="1722" data-end="1775" class="">Relax <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>‚àà</mo><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_i \in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6891em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">‚àà</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">]</span></span></span></span> to allow partial inclusion.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1776" data-end="1874" class="">
<p data-start="1778" data-end="1874" class="">Add slack variables <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7167em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">s</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">j</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> for symbolic grammar constraints (e.g., must preserve core theme).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>‚Å°</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>‚àà</mo><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence="true">{</mo><mstyle displaystyle="false" scriptlevel="0"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>‚àë</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence="true">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\min_{x \in [0,1]^n} \left\{ \tfrac{1}{2} x^T P x + q^T x + \sum_j s_j \right\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 3.1638em; vertical-align: -1.4138em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6679em;"><span style="top: -2.309em; margin-left: 0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span><span class="mrel mtight">‚àà</span><span class="mopen mtight">[</span><span class="mord mtight">0</span><span class="mpunct mtight">,</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span><span class="mclose mtight"><span class="mclose mtight">]</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.5935em;"><span style="top: -2.786em; margin-right: 0.0714em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.5em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><spa