<p data-start="1963" data-end="1969" class="">Where:</p>
<ul data-start="1970" data-end="2129">
<li data-start="1970" data-end="2020" class="">
<p data-start="1972" data-end="2020" class=""><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span></span></span></span> models path curvature and symbolic load.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2021" data-end="2075" class="">
<p data-start="2023" data-end="2075" class=""><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">q</span></span></span></span> encodes known semiotic entropy of each path.</p>
